{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"more_loop\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_loops\": [\n    \"S02-S05：在舍不得从前的自在、亲近与不甘心再受委屈之间反复摆动。S03-S04又从怀念转向盼望恢复旧日、怀疑当初是否走错，S05再回到不愿否定过去的好。但这几次摆动逐渐推进到允许好与坏同时存在。\",\n    \"S06-S08：在想念从前有人陪伴的亲近与离开后的孤单之间摆动。S07出现后悔和想回去的念头，S08又把问题推进到回忆无法替代现实陪伴，虽有重复，但认识有所深入。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_loops\": [\n    \"S06-S08：S06已经写到遇上难事只能自己挺过去、害怕再也没有亲近；S07又追问以后遇上难事能否独自撑住，并后悔离开；S08再次想到难处时回忆无法陪伴。连续几段反复围绕未来孤单、无人支持打转。\",\n    \"S09-S11：S09把想回去的原因理解为难受时想有人陪，S10又回到舍不得被当作自己人的亲近，S11则再次落到以后遇上难处只能自己扛的恐惧。对亲近与孤单的辨析没有像X那样持续收束。\",\n    \"S13：刚写出有劲头好好过日子，随后又退回想到未来孤单、不知何时再有人亲近的担忧。这与S01对未来缺乏安全感、S06-S11对独自面对困难的担忧形成重复。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y反复把已经出现过的孤单和未来无人支持的担忧重新提起，尤其S06-S08、S11和S13，甚至在结尾的向前动力中再次退回。X也有怀旧与不甘之间的摆动，但每次回返都增加了新的认识，最终走向对过去的整合和对当下生活的主动选择。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ebc7f0b9-2e1b-4db0-9d7e-ceb6d11c593e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T081635167252Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:17:08.439497+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5ed7defa4abb1b255ac4b0d9758e641da44d9639f522216e6c9cde5ee45070a5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T081635167252Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e92d252265ce0193452e62e5ec4d8e19999fb2130678d3580a2f1732b03ba649"}}}
